                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcc77417-f914-3fe4-8bc7-74ac00dadcfa",
                        "entry_id": "5c4f65ff-113d-37ea-a4bc-b56fc81d740e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The wall forming the side of a structure; a side wall.",
                            "The wall forming the side of a racquetball court."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "081342b2-1735-442a-a849-fde6ceffe15b",
                                "sense_id": "dcc77417-f914-3fe4-8bc7-74ac00dadcfa",
                                "text": "The kill shot may also be used against balls weakly played off the sidewall"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a41fb2e2-17d6-4eee-a756-7597ee0459d5",
                                "sense_id": "dcc77417-f914-3fe4-8bc7-74ac00dadcfa",
                                "text": "Mark flipped the ball to Jon for service. His high serve drifted perfectly down the left-hand court, and Mark's weakly hit return fell short off the sidewall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19fad659-7306-4307-8a10-eb918dad34bc",
                                "sense_id": "dcc77417-f914-3fe4-8bc7-74ac00dadcfa",
                                "text": "Further, the grazing blow caused the ball to pick up a furiously wicked spin, making it a madly twirling object. The ball skimmed off the sidewall near the corner and into the lower-right corner of the front wall."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
